WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.483 --> 00:00:01.919
Any video game fans here?

2
00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:03.661
(audience cheering)

3
00:00:03.661 --> 00:00:06.003
Well, this is pretty exciting,

4
00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:09.363
