9
00:00:21.091 --> 00:00:21.924
Hey!

10
00:00:21.924 --> 00:00:26.091
(audience applauding and cheering)

11
00:00:32.243 --> 00:00:33.245
Amazing.

12
00:00:33.245 --> 00:00:35.077
