13
00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:36.077
Thank you.

14
00:00:41.581 --> 00:00:45.576
It is so, it is so great to see you, Ronda.

15
00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:49.743
Could you please explain to us, who's this guy right here?

16
00:00:50.715 --> 00:00:53.675
This is Dustin and he's going to help us demonstrate

17
00:00:53.675 --> 00:00:55.831
exactly what it feels like to experience

18
00:00:55.831 --> 00:00:59.172
