19
00:00:59.172 --> 00:01:00.170
Are you ready, Dustin?

20
00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.371
Mm-hmm.

21
00:01:01.371 --> 00:01:03.056
Okay, you guys all ready to see this?

22
00:01:03.056 --> 00:01:05.216
(audience clapping and cheering)

23
00:01:05.216 --> 00:01:08.194
Why don't you, show them, Ronda.

24
00:01:08.194 --> 00:01:09.111
Here we go.

25
00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:12.069
Oh!

26
00:01:14.636 --> 00:01:16.154
Like that.

27
00:01:16.154 --> 00:01:17.737
That was awesome!

28
00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.720
You see, everyone look at that!

29
00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.262
You see Andy's reaction?

30
00:01:25.262 --> 00:01:27.118
That, is what it feels like to

31
00:01:27.118 --> 00:01:29.785
