32
00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:34.823
Now let's show them what it's like to play with friends.

33
00:01:35.275 --> 00:01:37.525
(groaning)

34
00:01:39.878 --> 00:01:43.561
Ronda Rousey, everybody, thanks, we'll be right back.

35
00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:46.144
